Auto Dance Skipauto_dance_skipeDances upon picking up some collectables, notably Golden Bananas, are removed (with some exceptions). D
	Fast Boot	fast_boot*The boot sequence is dramatically sped up. 
V

Calm Caves
calm_caves:Crystal Caves will no longer rain rocks down periodically. â
Animal Buddies grab Itemsanimal_buddies_grab_itemsORambi and Enguarde will be able to pick up DK's and Lanky's Items respectively. U
Reduced Lagreduced_lag9Lag is reduced where possible without hindering gameplay.y
Remove Extraneous Cutscenesremove_extraneous_cutscenes;A lot of cutscenes are removed, enabling a fast-paced game. ú
Hint Textbox Holdhint_textbox_holdrHint Textboxes will not close automatically upon the game reaching the end of the text, requiring B to be pressed. å
Remove Wrinkly Puzzlesremove_wrinkly_puzzlesXRemoves the Wrinkly Puzzles from the Angry Aztec, Fungi Forest and Crystal Caves lobbies é
Fast Picture Takingfast_picture_taking`The picture taking sequence is heavily sped up, with lag being significantly reduced on BizHawk. °

HUD Hotkey
hud_hotkeyÑPressing D-Pad Up will show the total amount of colored bananas acquired in the level, as well as the blueprint count for that Kong. Ä
